    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="2.3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IudDeiVIII">Iud Dei VIII</ref> 2.3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Forðan we ðe þonne geornlice biddaþ, Drihten hælend Crist, þæt u gedó her swilc tácn, gyf ðes man scyldig sy, þæt ðis wæter hine ne onfó.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Therefore, we now sincerely ask you, Lord Saviour Christ, that if this man is guilty, you would perform the following sign here: that this water may not receive him.</ab>
      </div>
